    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating thin film stack on fused silica substrate with air incident medium. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand) (starting with HfO2 at air interface, ending with SiO2 (Lemarchand) at substrate). Optimize all 24 individual layer thicknesses. Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance in 1530-1565 nm, maximize reflectance in 400-700 nm. Normal incidence. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with regularization penalty coefficient reduced by 25% relative to prior iteration, and initial thickness seed distribution mean shifted upward by 5 nm relative to the lower bound. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from catalog. Substrate: Fused Silica. Incident medium: Air. Maximum 30 layers constraint satisfied with 24 layers.",
